WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.062
Section 5.

00:00:02.012 --> 00:00:05.512
Missing Women — the investigations that weren't.

00:00:05.512 --> 00:00:09.887
For decades, Indigenous women disappeared across Canada.

00:00:09.887 --> 00:00:13.100
The RCMP failed to investigate.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:20.212
The National Inquiry into Missing and Murdered Indigenous Women and Girls found systemic institutional failures.

00:00:20.212 --> 00:00:25.150
The Highway of Tears, Robert Pickton's farm — the pattern was obvious.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:28.187
The RCMP chose not to see it.
